---
import ApproachCanvas from '../components/canvas/ApproachCanvas.astro'
import HeroMedia from '../components/canvas/HeroMedia.astro'
import InfoClock from '../components/InfoClock.astro'
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro'
import PageSection from '../components/PageSection.astro'
---

<PageLayout title="aoie — design studio">

  <!-- Top: hero + hero-media grouped with 16lh gap (Figma "Top" node) -->
  <div class="hero-top">
    <section class="hero page-wrap">
      <p class="text-heading hero-text">is a design studio that absorbs visual noise and builds a clear identity from concept to implementation. We are a response to a world where attention has become scarce and visual noise is the norm. Independence and flexibility over diffused responsibility. Direct dialogue over chains of approval.</p>
    </section>
    <div class="hero-media page-wrap">
      <HeroMedia images={['/01.png', '/02.png']} />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Information -->
  <PageSection title="Information">
    <div class="info-content">
      <div class="info-row">
        <div class="info-block">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="text-body info-key">Working globally</span>
            <span class="text-body info-val" id="info-clock">
              <InfoClock />
              <span class="info-clock-tz">CET</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-block">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="text-body info-key">Ownership</span>
            <span class="text-body info-val">Independent</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="text-body info-key">Founded</span>
            <span class="text-body info-val">2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="text-body info-key info-key--pad-line">Capabilities</span>
          <ul class="text-body info-list">
            <li>Creative Direction</li>
            <li>Strategy</li>
            <li>Visual Identity</li>
            <li>Graphic Design</li>
            <li>Motion Design</li>
            <li>Digital Design</li>
            <li>Campaign</li>
            <li>Narrative</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="text-body info-key info-key--pad-line">Experience</span>
          <p class="text-body info-val">With over 12 years of experience, we collaborate with e-commerce, art foundations, and media platforms. Based in Barcelona, work worldwide. We are eager to partner with international brands and share our passion for creating extraordinary things.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row info-row--people">
        <div class="info-person">
          <span class="text-body info-key">Anna Sharapova</span>
          <span class="text-body info-val">Co-Founder, Designer Director<br />16 years experience</span>
          <div class="info-photo"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-person">
          <span class="text-body info-key">Eduard Aksamitov</span>
          <span class="text-body info-val">Co-Founder, Art Director<br />10 years experience</span>
          <div class="info-photo"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </PageSection>

  <!-- Approach -->
  <PageSection title="Approach" mode="full-width">
    <p class="text-heading approach-text">Acting at the intersection of strategy and visual design, our work spans from research to finished product and everything in between. An officeless team where every project is led by those who create it. And beyond — through implementation, until the identity becomes reality. The client has a business, ambitions, a chaos of ideas and references. We ask questions, dig deep, strip away the excess — until only what works remains. From noise comes clarity that lasts for years. This is the distillation of essence.</p>
    <ApproachCanvas />
    <div class="section-grid">
      <div class="col-content approach-content">
        <div class="approach-row">
          <div class="approach-item">
            <h3 class="text-body approach-item-title">Sense</h3>
            <p class="text-body approach-item-desc">Before anything takes shape, we need to understand what we're actually solving. We ask questions about your business, your audience, and the gap between where you are and where you want to be. Sometimes that's a single conversation. Sometimes it's a structured session. Either way, it ends with something most projects skip: clarity you can actually build from.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="approach-item">
            <h3 class="text-body approach-item-title">Shape</h3>
            <p class="text-body approach-item-desc">This is where the brand gets its form — the mark, the system, the visual language. We build from intention, not intuition alone. Every decision has a reason, and the result is something that holds together under pressure: across formats, across teams, across time. We work from scratch or on top of what exists — in full or with precision.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-row">
          <div class="approach-item">
            <h3 class="text-body approach-item-title">Press</h3>
            <p class="text-body approach-item-desc">Design doesn't end at the file handoff. We see it through — guiding developers, tightening details, catching what gets lost between intent and implementation. And when the brand needs to exist beyond the screen, we know how to get it there. We work closely with print production, understand material constraints, and make sure what was designed survives contact with the real world.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="approach-item">
            <h3 class="text-body approach-item-title">Stay</h3>
            <p class="text-body approach-item-desc">Some clients need a partner who's just there. For questions, reviews, small refinements, and strategic moments — even after another studio's work. We're available on retainer, hourly, or by the task. No long commitments required. We stay as long as we're useful.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </PageSection>

  <!-- Offers -->
  <PageSection title="Offers" mode="full-width">
    <p class="text-heading offers-intro">We don't do rush jobs or undefined scopes. Good design takes time, and good collaboration takes structure. Depending on what you need, we work one of two ways — both designed to keep things clear, calm, and moving forward.</p>
    <div class="section-grid">
      <div class="col-content offers-content">
        <div class="offers-row">
          <div class="offer">
            <h3 class="text-body offer-title">Retainers</h3>
            <p class="text-body offer-desc">In close collaboration with you and your internal team, we work a set number of days per week over an extended period, where the length of it varies according to needs and deliverables. Through conversations tasks are defined and planned weekly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="offer">
            <h3 class="text-body offer-title">Projects</h3>
            <p class="text-body offer-desc">One project at a time with a fixed total cost based on deliverables. The project is planned, estimated, and deliverables specified before the project starts up.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="offers-row">
          <div class="offer">
            <h3 class="text-body offer-title">Consultancy</h3>
            <p class="text-body offer-desc">A focused conversation, not a deliverable. We help you understand a problem, evaluate a direction, or get unstuck. One or several sessions, depending on what you need. Suitable when you have a team but need an outside perspective, or when you're not sure yet what kind of help you actually need.</p>
          </div>
          <div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </PageSection>


</PageLayout>

<style>
  .hero-top {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--16-lh);
  }

  .hero {
    padding-top: var(--24-lh);
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 100%;
    text-indent: calc(var(--col-indent) * (100% + var(--col-gap)) / var(--cols));
  }

  .info-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--12-lh);
  }

  .info-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0 var(--col-gap);
    padding-top: var(--2-lh);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--color-gray-30);
  }

  .info-row:first-child {
    box-shadow: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .info-row:first-child .info-block {
    box-shadow: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .info-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--2-lh);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--color-border);
    padding-top: var(--lh);
  }

  .info-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .info-key {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .info-key--pad-line {
    padding-bottom: var(--2-lh);
  }

  .info-val {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  #info-clock {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 11px;
    font-variant-numeric: lining-nums tabular-nums;
  }

  .info-list {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .info-list li {
    line-height: var(--line-height-body);
  }

  .info-person {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--2-lh);
  }

  .info-photo {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    width: var(--32-lh);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .approach-text {
    text-indent: calc(var(--col-indent) * (100% + var(--col-gap)) / var(--cols));
    margin-bottom: var(--12-lh);
  }

  .approach-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-bottom: var(--12-lh);
  }

  .approach-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0 var(--col-gap);
    padding: var(--2-lh) 0 calc(var(--lh) * 10);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--color-gray-30);
  }

  .approach-row:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .approach-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--2-lh);
  }

  .approach-item-title {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .approach-item-desc {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .offers-intro {
    text-indent: calc(var(--col-indent) * (100% + var(--col-gap)) / var(--cols));
    margin-bottom: var(--12-lh);
  }

  .offers-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .offers-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0 var(--col-gap);
    padding: var(--2-lh) 0 calc(var(--lh) * 10);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--color-gray-30);
  }

  .offers-row:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .offer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--2-lh);
  }

  .offer-title {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .offer-desc {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Mobile (≤768px) */
  @media (--mobile) {
    .hero-top {
      gap: calc(var(--lh) * 8);
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: var(--12-lh);
    }

    .info-row,
    .approach-row,
    .offers-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Tablet (769–1024px) */
  @media (--tablet) {
    .hero-top {
      gap: var(--12-lh);
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: calc(var(--lh) * 18);
    }

    .info-row,
    .approach-row,
    .offers-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
